---

This library started from SSGINode.js in the three.js examples
(https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010-2026
three.js authors), itself a port of SSRT3 by Olivier Therrien
(https://github.com/cdrinmatane/SSRT3, MIT License).

The horizon CDF remaps and the view-vector slice frame follow GT-VBAO by
Mirko Salm (TinyTexel), https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XXGSDd, released under
a dual CC0 1.0 / MIT license.

The depth-MIP prefilter follows XeGTAO by Intel
(https://github.com/GameTechDev/XeGTAO, MIT License).
